    <td width="98%" align="center" valign="top"><div class="white"> 
        <h5><strong>"Central America travel photos"</strong></h5>
        <h6>The website presents <strong>photographs from Central American 
          countries</strong>: <strong>Costa Rica, Panama and Mexico.</strong><br />
          All the pictures were taken by <strong>Anita Kucharska and Maciek "Kruger" Kiersztyn</strong>, 
          during the travel to Central America in 2004. The travel itinerary is 
          shown on the maps of Costa Rica, Panama and Mexico, also included here.<br />
          The photos from Costa Rica show national parks of Tortugero, Manuel 
          Antonio and Las Baulas; Volcanos: Po&aacute;s, Iraz&uacute;, Arenal; 
          Tabac&oacute;n resort, the capital San Jos&eacute; and coffee plantations 
          in the Orosi valley.<br />Photographs from Panama include the Panama 
          Canal (Miraflores locks), the capital Panama City and Casco Antiguo.<br /> 
          In Mexico City the pictures show a walk through the historic center (Zócalo).<br /><strong>(C)2005 Copyrights by Anita Kucharska & Maciek "Kruger" Kiersztyn.</strong></h6>
      </div></td>
    <td width="1%" align="left" valign="top"><img src="gfx/adv-bar-right.gif"></td>
  </tr>
</table>



